sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Browser
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant NG as frontend pod<br/>(nginx)
    participant AU as auth-service
    participant ST as streaming-service
    participant CH as chat-service
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant S3 as S3

    Note over U,NG: Everything is same-origin — nginx proxies /svc/* so there is no CORS

    U->>ALB: GET /
    ALB->>NG: GET / (target-type ip)
    NG-->>U: index.html + hashed JS/CSS

    U->>ALB: POST /svc/auth/api/login
    ALB->>NG: proxy
    NG->>AU: POST /api/login
    AU->>DB: find user, verify bcrypt hash
    DB-->>AU: user document
    AU-->>NG: 200 + JWT
    NG-->>U: 200 + JWT

    U->>ALB: GET /svc/streaming/api/streaming/videos
    ALB->>NG: proxy
    NG->>ST: GET /api/streaming/videos
    ST->>DB: query catalogue
    ST->>S3: presign GET for each media key
    S3-->>ST: signed URLs
    ST-->>U: catalogue + signed URLs

    U->>S3: GET signed URL (direct, bypasses the cluster)
    S3-->>U: video bytes

    U->>ALB: WebSocket upgrade /socket.io/
    ALB->>NG: upgrade (idle_timeout 3600s)
    NG->>CH: upgrade (proxy_read_timeout 3600s)
    CH->>CH: verify JWT on handshake
    CH-->>U: connected
    U->>CH: chat:message
    CH->>DB: persist message
    CH-->>U: broadcast to room
